COMM 39K(p,gamma)40Ca 4-gamma cascade, script-generated dense-grid
COMM point (generate_reactions.py) -- terminus: true ground state, e_budget =
COMM 8.93377 MeV. Every level is a FICTIONAL placeholder, unused by
COMM kinematics beyond fixing gamma energies (see ReactionConfig.hh's own LEVL
COMM comment) -- same convention as every hand-written file in this directory.
COMM 4-gamma Sobol grid-supplement point.
COMM Levels (excitation above terminus, MeV): L1=5.5372, L2=6.1397, L3=6.5765
COMM Gamma energies before recoil-kinematics corrections (MeV): gamma1=2.3573, gamma2=0.4368, gamma3=0.6025, gamma4=5.5372
COMM Verify with `--reaction-stats <this file>`.

BEAM 19  39   -33.8072     # Z A massExcessMeV -- 39K
TARG 1   1    7.28897      # 1H (target, at rest)
RECL 20  40   -34.846     8  # 40Ca -- true ground state
ERES 0.606                  # CM resonance energy above threshold, MeV

LEVL   1   5.5372   1.0E-12   # fictional level 1
LEVL   2   6.1397   1.0E-12   # fictional level 2
LEVL   3   6.5765   1.0E-12   # fictional level 3

BRAT   -1  100.0   3        # resonance -> highest level, 100%
BRAT    3  100.0   2        # level 3 -> level 2, 100%
BRAT    2  100.0   1        # level 2 -> level 1, 100%
BRAT    1  100.0   0        # level 1 -> terminus, 100%
SENT
